{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "动画用读指针扫描数组，写指针始终指向下一个非零元素应放置的位置；遇到非零数时原地写入并推进写指针，零则直接跳过。扫描结束后，从写指针开始把剩余位置填成 0，即可保持非零元素的相对顺序，且不需要复制数组。示例最终由 [0,1,0,3,12] 变为 [1,3,12,0,0]。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>移动零可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.app{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:block}.panel{width:100%;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;box-shadow:none}h1{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}.sub{color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:12px}.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,38px);gap:6px;margin:8px auto;justify-content:center}.cell{position:relative;min-height:48px;width:38px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:700 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.35s}.cell.read{border-color:#3794ff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #3794ff}.cell.write{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.cell.changed{animation:pulse .45s ease}.idx{position:absolute;bottom:-14px;color:#8d8d8d;font:9px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.pointer{position:absolute;top:-18px;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap}.pointer.r{color:#3794ff}.pointer.w{color:#fff;background:#0e639c;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:4px}.info{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px;margin-top:18px;padding:8px 10px;background:#2a2d2e;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}.message{min-height:auto;line-height:1.45;font-size:12px}.message strong{color:#3794ff}.count{font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#8d8d8d}.bar{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px}.progress{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s linear}.legend{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:4px}.blue{background:#3794ff}.block{background:#0e639c}.phase{color:#3794ff}@keyframes pulse{50%{transform:scale(1.05);background:#1177bb}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"app\"><section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>双指针原地整理</h1><div class=\"sub\">示例：nums = [0, 1, 0, 3, 12]</div>\n<div id=\"array\" class=\"array\"></div>\n<div class=\"info\"><div id=\"message\" class=\"message\"></div><div id=\"count\" class=\"count\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"bar\"><div id=\"progress\" class=\"progress\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot blue\"></i>读指针：检查当前元素</span><span><i class=\"dot block\"></i>写指针：下一个非零元素的位置</span><span class=\"phase\">先压缩非零元素，再补零</span></div>\n</section></main>\n<script>\nconst work=[0,1,0,3,12],frames=[];\nlet write=0,writes=0;\nfunction save(r,c,t){frames.push({a:[...work],r,w:write<work.length?write:-1,c,t,n:writes})}\nfor(let read=0;read<work.length;read++){\n const value=work[read];\n save(read,-1,'读指针检查下标 '+read+': 值为 '+value+'.');\n if(value===0){save(read,-1,'读到 0, 跳过. 写指针保持在 '+write+'.');continue}\n const dest=write;work[write++]=value;writes++;\n save(read,dest,'已把 '+value+' 写入下标 '+dest+'. 写指针前进到 '+write+'.');\n}\nsave(-1,-1,'扫描完成, 前 '+write+' 项是按原顺序压缩的非零元素. 开始补零.');\nwhile(write<work.length){const dest=write;work[write++]=0;writes++;save(-1,dest,'已把下标 '+dest+' 填为 0.')}\nsave(-1,-1,'完成: [1,3,12,0,0]. 时间 O(n), 额外空间 O(1).');\nconst box=document.getElementById('array'),msg=document.getElementById('message'),count=document.getElementById('count'),progress=document.getElementById('progress');let k=0;\nfunction draw(f){box.innerHTML='';f.a.forEach((v,i)=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='cell'+(i===f.r?' read':'')+(i===f.w?' write':'')+(i===f.c?' changed':'');d.textContent=v;const ix=document.createElement('span');ix.className='idx';ix.textContent=i;d.appendChild(ix);if(i===f.r){const p=document.createElement('span');p.className='pointer r';p.textContent=i===f.w?'读 / 写':'读';d.appendChild(p)}if(i===f.w&&i!==f.r){const p=document.createElement('span');p.className='pointer w';p.textContent='写';d.appendChild(p)}box.appendChild(d)});msg.innerHTML=f.t;count.textContent='数组写入 '+f.n+' 次';progress.style.width=((k+1)/frames.length*100)+'%'}\nfunction next(){draw(frames[k]);k=(k+1)%frames.length}next();setInterval(next,1400);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(1)",
  "complexity_note": "n 为数组长度. 读指针扫描一次, 写指针压缩非零元素后补零; 原地修改输入, 只使用常数个变量."
}
